[[File:Tiger shark safe spot south-east of Ape Atoll.png|thumb|A safe spot for tiger sharks using the rocks south-east of [[Ape Atoll]] and south-west of [[Crash Island]]. Reverse the boat into the position shown in the screenshot from the north-east, such that the forward cannon (closest to the bow) is on top the small northernmost rock. The tiger shark to the south-east will then get stuck on the large rocks as shown.

''Note that, while unlikely, it is possible for the shark to wander immediately after it respawns such that it paths around the rocks to the boat instead of getting stuck. Therefore, consider bringing some [[repair kit]]s.]]
'''Tiger sharks''' are monsters found in the [[Western Ocean]], [[Sunset Ocean]], and [[Ardent Ocean]]. The player may be assigned to kill them as a [[bounty task]] starting at 55 [[Sailing]]. A guaranteed bounty task can be received from the [[Red Rock]] and [[Port Piscarilius]].

Boats require a [[dragon keel]] to not take any damage from tiger sharks.

